... and also Andrew.Simpson@motorola.com for having a broken and
dangerous autoreply, replying to the address in the From: header instead
of the SMTP reverse-path.

If you ever get autoreplies to mail you sent to the list, please let me
know immediately and I'll kick the offending subscriber.

Remember, kids.... autoreplies must go _only_ to the SMTP reverse-path
(the 'MAIL FROM:<...>' address in the SMTP transaction), and must always
have an empty reverse-path of their own, like bounces.

